=== REASONING ===
Widget maps BatteryCell[] from useBatteryCells hook to StatusCell[] for WidgetStatusGrid.
Color coding: deviation from avg voltage — ≤5mV → ok (green), ≤15mV → warning (amber), >15mV → error (red).
Standard (2×4): 3-col heatmap grid + 2×2 stat cards (min/max/avg/spread voltage).
Wide (3×4+): 4-col grid showing temp per cell in value, plus 3-col temperature stats row.
Compact (cols≤1): 2-col grid, compact mode, no title, values hidden by WidgetStatusGrid compact.
All freshness props passed to WidgetShell. All strings i18n'd. Null-safe throughout.
StatCard className="!p-2" for compact sizing since no size prop exists.

